WEBVTT

00:11:26.525 --> 00:11:30.091
Because that's sadistic behavior,
and we know, psychiatry knows,

00:11:30.115 --> 00:11:32.207
only one percent
of Americans are sadistic.

00:11:32.231 --> 00:11:33.431
OK.

00:11:33.987 --> 00:11:36.593
Here's the data.
They could not be more wrong.

00:11:36.617 --> 00:11:39.438
Two thirds go all the way to 450 volts.

00:11:39.462 --> 00:11:40.976
This was just one study.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.284
Milgram did more than 16 studies.

00:11:43.308 --> 00:11:44.541
And look at this.

00:11:45.331 --> 00:11:48.168
In study 16, where you see
somebody like you go all the way,

00:11:48.192 --> 00:11:49.660
90 percent go all the way.

00:11:50.287 --> 00:11:52.475
In study five, if you see people rebel,

00:11:52.499 --> 00:11:53.842
90 percent rebel.

00:11:54.612 --> 00:11:57.457
What about women?
Study 13 -- no different than men.

00:11:57.778 --> 00:12:01.319
So Milgram is quantifying evil
as the willingness of people